Package: chichi77-keykey-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: shared input-method data for chichi77 KeyKey
 This package contains the architecture-independent Bopomofo, Cangjie,
 Simplex, conversion, and built-in associated-phrase data used by the native
 Linux chichi77 KeyKey input methods.

Package: fcitx5-chichi77-keykey
Architecture: any
Depends:
 chichi77-keykey-data (= ${source:Version}),
 fcitx5,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: chichi77 KeyKey input methods for Fcitx 5
 This package provides native Fcitx 5 Bopomofo, Cangjie, and Simplex input
 methods. It uses the separately packaged chichi77 KeyKey data tables.
